        }
      ],
      "Category": "Operations, User Experience, Product Management",
      "Tool Description": "Notion is an all-in-one workspace for notes, documents, wikis, and simple databases. Teams use it to keep everything in one place, meeting notes, project plans, and shared knowledge that would otherwise get scattered, so anyone can find what they need without digging through a dozen tools.",
      "Tool Features": "1. Create docs and wikis\n2. Build databases and boards\n3. Organize a team knowledge base\n4. Track tasks and backlogs\n5. Collaborate in real time",
      "Tool Direct Competitors": "1. [Confluence](https://www.atlassian.com/software/confluence)\n1. [Gitbook](http://gitbook.com)",
