        }
      ],
      "Category": "User Experience, Product Management",
      "Tool Description": "FigJam is an online whiteboard made by Figma, built for the messy, collaborative early stages of work. Teams use it to brainstorm, map ideas on sticky notes, run workshops, and sketch flows together, making it a natural home for group thinking before designs get polished.",
      "Tool Features": "1. Run sticky-note workshops\n2. Draw diagrams and flows\n3. Brainstorm as a group\n4. Vote and react in real time\n5. Start from templates",
      "Tool Direct Competitors": "1. [Miro](https://miro.com/)\n1. [Lucidspark](https://lucidspark.com/)",
